text MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt14Intro {
    "What, what, what?\p"
    "Only TEAM MAGMA members are supposed\n"
    "to be in here!\p"
    "But you're not dressed in TEAM MAGMA's\n"
    "uniform…\p"
    "You rouse my suspicion!\n"
    "Battle with me!$"
}

text MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt14Defeat {
    "Aiyiyi…\n"
    "My pride as a TEAM MAGMA member…$"
}

text MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt14PostBattle {
    "If you suffer from chills, you should\n"
    "join TEAM MAGMA.$"
}

text MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt3Intro {
    "Hold it right there!\p"
    "You don't really expect me to keep\n"
    "my trap shut and let you waltz by me?$"
}

text MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt3Defeat {
    "Ooh wow!\n"
    "I concede!$"
}

text MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt3PostBattle {
    "Maybe it would've been better if I did\n"
    "just let you go unchallenged…$"
}

text MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt4Intro {
    "Ahah!\n"
    "An intruder!$"
}

text MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt4Defeat {
    "Graaah!$"
}

text MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt4PostBattle {
    "I've already lost.\p"
    "Do I really need to keep running\n"
    "around in a circle?$"
}

text MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt5Intro {
    "Oh, oh!\n"
    "An intruder!$"
}

text MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt5Defeat {
    "Mutter…$"
}

text MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt5PostBattle {
    "Actually, I'm no expert at battling…$"
}
